  <p>Although the results sometimes differ for individual series, the overall picture is consistent across the three measures and only the MASE results are reported here. Plots of pairwise comparisons of MASE values for the different models are given in Figure 4. Further study is clearly necessary, but the limited results suggest that model 1 is inferior to the other two. Of the two lognormal models (6) appears to be marginally preferable. Of</p>
